---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms of Use | Toolbox Image" description="The terms that govern your use of the free, browser-based image tools on Toolbox Image." path="/terms" lang="en" altLang={null}>
  <div class="legal-wrap">
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">LEGAL</span>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated: June 5, 2026</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">1</span>Who we are</h2>
      <p>Toolbox Image provides browser-based image editing tools, including image blurring and related utilities. The service is operated from Singapore.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">2</span>Use of the service</h2>
      <p>You may use the site only for lawful purposes. Do not misuse the service, interfere with its operation, or use it in a way that violates the rights of others.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">3</span>Your content</h2>
      <p>You remain responsible for the files you edit, download, or share. All image tools, including AI Unblur, process selected files locally in your browser.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">4</span>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>The site design, branding, software, and related content are owned by Toolbox Image or used with permission. These terms do not transfer ownership rights to you.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">5</span>Availability and changes</h2>
      <p>We may update, improve, suspend, or discontinue parts of the service at any time. We may also update these terms by publishing a new version on this page.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="num">6</span>Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about these terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:yangkunming2026@gmail.com">yangkunming2026@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
